    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack are delighted to present this impressive 5 bedroom detached home to the market, situated in the peaceful rural location of Craan, Leighlinbridge, Co. Carlow.\n\nOffering generous and versatile accommodation over two floors, this property is an ideal family home with excellent potential for those seeking space both inside and out. The accommodation briefly comprises a large entrance hall, sitting room, living room, dining room, kitchen, downstairs bedroom and a bathroom. Upstairs, there are four further double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a main family bathroom.\n\nA particular feature of this property is the excellent outdoor space. The house is approached via a generous tarmac driveway, providing ample parking and leading to the property and its substantial detached garage. The garage is fitted with two roller doors, electricity and an epoxy-coated floor, making it an excellent addition for anyone requiring a workshop, home business, storage or hobby space.\n\nThe large garden is well established and benefits from mature hedging boundaries, offering privacy and a pleasant setting around the property. There is also a separate standalone shed, providing additional valuable storage.\n\nThe property is serviced by oil-fired central heating and, with its generous room proportions, five double bedrooms and excellent range of external buildings, it offers a fantastic opportunity for a purchaser looking for a spacious home in a peaceful countryside setting while remaining within easy reach of local amenities.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the generous accommodation, extensive gardens and excellent range of ancillary buildings this property has to offer.\n\nCall DNG McCormack to make an appointment to view. 0599133800."
      },
